## Pavé and Micropavé Settings: $1,050 to $2,290

Pavé settings add brilliant-cut diamond accents to the rose gold band. The contrast between the step-cut emerald cut center stone and the brilliant-cut pavé diamonds creates layered visual interest. The warm rose gold ties both sections together.

[![Emerald cut diamond rose gold ring micropave band](/images/emerald-cut-diamond-rose-gold-ring-micropave.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?styleIDs=all&MetalType=rg&ShapeID=Emerald&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

**Petite Micropavé Lab-Grown Diamond Ring in 14k Rose Gold (1/10 ct tw) — [$1,050](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/petite-micropave-lab-grown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-1-10-ct-tw-item-309319?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (738 reviews)

738 reviews — the second highest review count in this lineup. A thin band with micropavé accents running partially up the shank. The lab-grown accent diamonds are indistinguishable from natural at this size.

This is the most accessible pavé rose gold setting. For buyers who want a hint of sparkle on the band without a dramatic pavé look, this is the right call.

**Riviera Pavé Lab-Grown Diamond Ring in 14k Rose Gold (1/6 ct tw) — [$1,250](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/riviera-pave-lab-grown-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-1-6-ct-tw-item-309312?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (479 reviews)

479 reviews. The Riviera design places pavé diamonds along a straight band that runs flat across the finger — no taper, no cathedral, just a clean horizontal diamond row. The straight band design echoes the horizontal geometry of the emerald cut.

1/6 ct tw means more visible pavé coverage than the micropavé option above.

**Perfect Pavé Diamond Ring in 14k Rose Gold by James Allen — [$1,755](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/perfect-pave-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-314963?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (158 reviews)

158 reviews. James Allen's "Perfect Pavé" places diamonds in a shared-prong setting that maximizes diamond coverage on the band while minimizing metal between stones. The result is a diamond-covered band that reads as continuous sparkle.

The step-cut emerald cut center stone provides the architectural contrast that keeps the ring from looking too busy.

[![Emerald cut diamond rose gold ring pave band setting](/images/emerald-cut-diamond-rose-gold-ring-pave-band.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?styleIDs=all&MetalType=rg&ShapeID=Emerald&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

**Pavé Twist Diamond Ring in 14k Rose Gold by James Allen — [$2,290](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/pave-twist-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-314945?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (126 reviews)

126 reviews. The band twists in opposite directions toward the center stone, creating a spiral pavé effect that adds three-dimensional movement to the shank. The twisted band contrasts visually with the rigid horizontal geometry of the step-cut emerald cut — the organic movement of the band against the precise architecture of the stone.

